# Pictures of the pause menu's settings pages (DISPLAY, PERFORMANCE, CONTROLS) next to the game's own Settings list and its OPTIONS page,
# once with Xbox prompts and once with PlayStation prompts (the cvar mcla_button_prompts, set live), for a run at any resolution scale.
# {SHOT} (the folder the pictures go to) and {SCALE} (the pictures' size: 1 for 1x, 0.75 for 2x, 0.5 for 3x) are filled in by whoever starts the run.
# Each page: its top, its middle and its bottom (the list scrolls; its last rows and its scroll bar are down there).
# The Settings list is OPTIONS, STATISTICS, CHEAT CODES, MUSIC PLAYLISTS, DISPLAY (4 down), PERFORMANCE, CONTROLS; leaving a page puts the selection back on it.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark free_roam
wait 8s
log menu-pages: xbox prompts
set mcla_button_prompts xbox
wait 600ms 36f
press start 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
press rb 4f
wait 1000ms 60f
shot {SHOT}/xbox-00-settings-tab.png {SCALE}
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
shot {SHOT}/xbox-01-own-options.png {SCALE}
press b 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
press down 4f
wait 400ms 24f
press down 4f
wait 400ms 24f
press down 4f
wait 400ms 24f
press down 4f
wait 400ms 24f
press a 4f
wait 1500ms 90f
shot {SHOT}/xbox-10-display-top.png {SCALE}
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
press down 4f
wait 300ms 18f
wait 500ms 30f
